Z||000000||BC-GT||05-15-2001||09:05 PM||||So I'm up at 6:30 in the morning and just checking out the forum when my girlfriend turns the idiot box on and within seconds I hear an ad for Fiero, thought i was in some kind of time warp, look over at her and say "what the hell was that". Turns out to be a rerun of some dating type show from mid eighties with the grand prize being a Fiero!!<BR>Anyway, I taped it today so I am going to see if I can get it transfered to MPEG. It's only about 10 or 15 seconds long all together, but kinda neat.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||5
